<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="234">
<p>肿瘤诊断学（超声、核医学）</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="261">
<p>掌握：超声成像原理，超声诊断过程中声图像分析，不同甲状腺疾病超声诊断的声像学表现，乳腺疾病的超声诊断的声像学表现；肿瘤PET显像的临床应用、<sup>18</sup>F-FDG显像的原理；骨显像的临床应用、正常全身骨显像影像学表现，异常骨显像表现，解释“超级骨显像”、“双轨征”以及“炸面圈”征，骨转移及股骨头缺血性坏死的骨显像影像特点；</p>
<p>熟悉：肝胆疾病和泌尿系统疾病的超声诊断声像学表现；PET分钟影像显像剂的种类、显像方法及影像分析要点；骨静态显像的原理及方法、适应征；</p>
<p>了解：女性生殖系统疾病超声诊断声像学表现，超声诊断新技术；肿瘤PET显像剂的种类和作用；骨断层显像和骨关节显像的原理方法；</p>
<p>自学：超声新技术的原理及应用，超声对于脏器良性疾病的声像学表现；PET显像的基础物理部分；核医学SPECT脏器显像（心脏、呼吸、泌尿系统等）的原理及应用；</p>
</td>
</tr>
