</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="261">
<p>掌握：肿瘤多学科综合治疗的概念；综合治疗的基本原则和模式，并通过结合典型临床病例分析运用到临床实践中；</p>
<p>了解：开展多学科、多手段、多方法的综合治疗是目前提高肿瘤治愈率、延长肿瘤患者生存期最重要的方法；</p>
</td>
</tr>
